5 is in the thousands place → 5 × 1 000 = 5 000;
6 is in the hundreds place → 6 × 100 = 600;
4 is in the tens place → 4 × 10 = 40;
2 is in the units place → 2 × 1 = 2.

9 is in the thousands place → 9 × 1 000 = 9 000;
0 is in the hundreds place → 0;
5 is in the tens place → 5 × 10 = 50;
1 is in the units place → 1.
